  "description": "Dragon talisman tracker with progress history. Live panel in a UI tab named 'Talismans'; optional larger chart in a tab named 'TalGraph'. History is stored in the tal_hist variable as [unixSeconds, cappedCommon, cappedRare], one point per hour in which totals change."
